@node Top
@top Lena — An Emacs major mode for Lean

Lena is a set of packages that extend @uref{https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/, GNU Emacs} for the @uref{https://lean-lang.org, Lean} language. It is
based off @uref{https://codeberg.org/mekeor/nael, Nael} additionally providing an infoview@comma{} signs in the margin and more.
See @ref{Credits, , Credits} for more information about Lena's lineage.

Lena is not on Elpa or Melpa yet. To install Lena@comma{} use @code{package-vc} or a clone of
this repository@comma{} see @ref{Install, , Install} for detailed instructions.

@strong{Note}: Much of the code that Lena adds to Nael was written with the help of AI
assistants and reviewed@comma{} tested and revised by Lena's maintainers.

@end ifnottex

